---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import screenLogin from '../assets/img/screenshot_login.png';
---

<Layout title="Panduan Token API - BIG Downloader Toolbox">
	<article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10 sm:py-16">
		<nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="mb-6">
			<ol class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono text-ink-muted">
				<li><a href="/" class="hover:text-accent transition-colors">Beranda</a></li>
				<li aria-hidden="true">/</li>
				<li class="text-ink" aria-current="page">Panduan Token API</li>
			</ol>
		</nav>

		<header class="pb-8 border-b border-line space-y-4">
			<div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg border border-line bg-surface flex items-center justify-center text-accent">
				<svg class="w-6 h-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" aria-hidden="true">
					<circle cx="8" cy="15" r="4" />
					<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M11.2 12.2L20 4m-3 0h3v3m-4 1l2 2" />
				</svg>
			</div>
			<h1 class="font-display font-extrabold text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-ink">
				Cara Mendapatkan Token API Ina-Geoportal
			</h1>
			<p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-ink-secondary leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
				Token akses diperlukan untuk autentikasi saat mengunduh data DEMNAS, BATNAS, dan RBI dari server Tanah Air Badan Informasi Geospasial (BIG).
			</p>
		</header>

		<section class="mt-8 rounded-xl border border-line bg-surface p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-6">
			<h2 class="font-display font-bold text-xl sm:text-2xl text-ink">Langkah Pengambilan Token</h2>

			<ol class="space-y-6 text-ink-secondary leading-relaxed">
				<li class="space-y-2">
					<h3 class="font-display font-bold text-base sm:text-lg text-ink">1. Buka halaman login Ina-Geoportal</h3>
					<p>
						Jalankan Tool #1 di toolbox atau buka langsung halaman
						<a
							href="https://tanahair.indonesia.go.id/portal-web/login"
							target="_blank"
							rel="noopener noreferrer"
							class="text-hydro font-medium underline"
						>
							Login Ina-Geoportal
						</a>.
						Jangan langsung menekan tombol Masuk sebelum Developer Tools terbuka.
					</p>
				</li>

				<li class="space-y-2">
					<h3 class="font-display font-bold text-base sm:text-lg text-ink">2. Buka panel Network pada Developer Tools</h3>
					<p>
						Tekan tombol <kbd class="font-mono text-xs bg-subtle border border-line px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-ink">F12</kbd> pada keyboard (atau klik kanan lalu pilih <em>Inspect</em>), kemudian buka tab <strong class="text-ink">Network</strong>.
					</p>
				</li>

				<li class="space-y-2">
					<h3 class="font-display font-bold text-base sm:text-lg text-ink">3. Lakukan login akun</h3>
					<p>
						Isi username dan password akun Ina-Geoportal Anda, lalu klik tombol <strong class="text-ink">Masuk / Login</strong> sementara tab Network tetap terbuka.
					</p>
				</li>

				<li class="space-y-2">
					<h3 class="font-display font-bold text-base sm:text-lg text-ink">4. Cari request signin dan salin accessToken</h3>
					<p>
						Pada daftar permintaan Network, ketik <code class="font-mono text-xs bg-subtle px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-ink">signin</code> pada kolom filter lalu klik request tersebut. Buka tab <strong class="text-ink">Preview</strong> atau <strong class="text-ink">Response</strong>, kemudian salin nilai di dalam <code class="font-mono text-xs bg-subtle px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-ink">accessToken</code>.
					</p>
					<pre class="mt-2 bg-subtle border border-line rounded-md p-3 font-mono text-xs text-ink overflow-x-auto"><code>accessToken: "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..."</code></pre>
				</li>
			</ol>

			<figure class="rounded-lg border border-line bg-subtle/40 overflow-hidden">
				<div class="p-3">
					<Image
						src={screenLogin}
						alt="Tangkapan layar Tool #1 Login INA-Geoportal di QGIS yang menampilkan panduan 8 langkah pengambilan token"
						width={936}
						height={846}
						loading="lazy"
						class="w-full h-auto block rounded border border-line/70"
					/>
				</div>
				<figcaption class="px-4 py-2.5 bg-subtle/80 border-t border-line text-xs text-ink-muted">
					Tangkapan layar Tool #1 (Login INA-Geoportal) di QGIS beserta ringkasan urutan pengambilan token.
				</figcaption>
			</figure>

			<div class="callout callout-warn">
				<strong>Perhatian:</strong> Token API bersifat sementara (sekitar 1 sampai 2 jam). Jika proses unduhan berhenti dengan pesan Unauthorized, ulangi langkah di atas untuk mengambil token baru.
			</div>
		</section>

		<nav aria-label="Panduan lanjutan" class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-line flex flex-wrap gap-3 justify-between">
			<a
				href="/#download"
				class="min-h-[44px] px-4 inline-flex items-center rounded-md border border-control/70 bg-surface hover:bg-subtle text-sm font-semibold text-ink transition-colors"
			>
				Kembali ke Pusat Unduhan
			</a>
			<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
				<a href="/guide_demnas" class="min-h-[44px] px-4 inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-accent hover:bg-accent-hover text-accent-ink text-sm font-semibold transition-colors">
					Lanjut ke Panduan DEMNAS
				</a>
				<a href="/guide_rbi" class="min-h-[44px] px-4 inline-flex items-center rounded-md border border-control/70 bg-surface hover:bg-subtle text-sm font-semibold text-ink transition-colors">
					Panduan RBI
				</a>
			</div>
		</nav>
	</article>
</Layout>
